'''Scantily Clad''' (薄着コーデ, ''Usugi Kōde'', '''Light Clothing Coordination''') is a 3-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 7.4 Update|Version 7.4]] and is unlocked after completing [[Into the Future]] Chapter 1.

==Effect==
"Massive Damage" Effect UP (M): The effect of this ability is increased by 20%.

==Combo==
{{Combos
|{{CatCombo|Scantily Clad|"Massive Damage" Effects Up (M)|Pharaoh Reika|Skirt Cat|Panties Cat|jpname=薄着コーデ}}
}}

==Trivia==
*'''Scantily Clad''' means to wear very little clothing, often almost naked. This obviously references the fact that units present in this combo are wearing very little clothing.

